# Staff turnover (Umsetzung 3)
{116}{}{A new face in the house. Someone who wanted out of where they were.}
{117}{}{Someone new was brought in. They don't look at anyone.}
{118}{}{One of our people is gone. Packed up and left.}
{119}{}{One of the ones who were brought in ran off. Nobody saw anything.}

# Prologue aftermath
{120}{}{Metzger counted again. The debt note is missing, and he knows who took it.}
{121}{}{One of the ones in the cellar got out. Nobody saw anything.}

# Chains, acts 2-5 (Umsetzung 5)
{130}{}{Essie wants to see you. It can't wait.}
{131}{}{Kolbe found something in the cellar. He's waiting for your word.}
{132}{}{Metzger's men turned the Den upside down last night. They searched the Gutter. They never found the door to the hidden room.}
{133}{}{Metzger's men searched the Gutter and found Mara. They dragged her out by the hair. Everybody in the house watched.}
{134}{}{The transport made it south. The Rangers took them in. Nobody in the Den will ever know their names.}
{135}{}{The transport was caught on the road. Metzger knows now who has been hiding them.}
{136}{}{The shipment arrived. Kolbe put $}
{137}{}{ in the till and said nothing else.}
{138}{}{Rangers stopped the shipment on the road. The ones in chains are free, and the Rangers have a description of the wagon.}
{139}{}{Tyler's boys have been asking questions about the Gutter.}
{140}{}{Word is Lara's people know what's in your cellar.}
{141}{}{Metzger is dead. The Guild is finished. For one night the pens of the Den stand open, and nobody closes them.}
{142}{}{Metzger is dead. Kolbe and the boys in the pens are waiting for your orders. The Guild is yours.}
{143}{}{Someone is waiting for you in the Gutter. Essie says you'll know her.}
{144}{}{Mara is gone. She left a note on Essie's table: "You know why."}

